Posting results preserve every field and transaction source in journal order.

========== API ==========

postings({ from: '2024-01-02', to: '2024-01-03', accounts: ['^Assets:'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Buy fund  ; imported
  ; Project: Savings
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK  ; [2024-01-03] card
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {10 SEK} @ 100 SEK

2024-01-04 Opening balance
  Assets:Cash  20 SEK = 20 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "postingId": 1,
    "transactionId": 6,
    "transactionDate": "2024-01-02",
    "filename": "{{JOURNAL_PATH}}",
    "transactionSourceLine": 8,
